{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_document", "label": "Implementation Plan \u2014 WorkflowHub execution flow and review reliability repair", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L1-536", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_dec_002", "label": "DEC-002 \u2014 One public review group with internal reconstruct\u2192reveal\u2192challenge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L172-180", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keeps configured multi-provider heterogeneity while adding only one public request; fallback keeps the single terminal group fact and never opens a second same-scope review."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_dec_003", "label": "DEC-003 \u2014 Separate deadline from liveness", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L182-190", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lifecycle ownership belongs to the external broker; WorkflowHub passes deadline_ms:null and only consumes narrow liveness terminal facts, keeping the protocol thin and the real state truthful."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_dec_004", "label": "DEC-004 \u2014 Reuse four materials and the existing evidence base", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L192-200", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Extending plan/tasks contracts while reusing facts/index/verify/quality satisfies the handoff requirement without creating a fifth authority; missing structure or evidence stays incomplete rather than spawning a replacement projection."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_dec_006", "label": "DEC-006 \u2014 External owner isolation with a narrow in-scope repair", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L212-220", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The real Stage Agent host and 3rd-review broker live outside this repo and their worktree is dirty; bounded edits to the declared deadline/health/direction-flow/retry bytes satisfy the authorized root-cause fix without building a second control plane or discarding user dirty facts."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_dec_007", "label": "DEC-007 \u2014 WorkflowHub profile key as route identity (remove duplicate raw source_id gate)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L222-230", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Users should not have to maintain a second raw source_id field for the same provider; route/profile/model/config-snapshot preflight stays a zero-dispatch boundary while broker result provenance proves the final cross-source fact."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_phase_p1", "label": "Phase P1 \u2014 Interaction lifecycle and stage order", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L351-387", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Makes batched questioning and real ask\u2192wait\u2192matching-reply\u2192resume verifiable contracts while locking the already-correct make-decision steps order; STOP if an agent answers for the user, fakes a batch, or adds a public interaction runtime."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_phase_p2", "label": "Phase P2 \u2014 Single-group multi-provider review and blind direction order", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L389-425", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One public group per review face from the current route snapshot, one request per provider, reconstruct\u2192reveal\u2192challenge inside that request, aggregation only after all terminals; profile/config preflight failure must mean zero dispatch."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_phase_p3", "label": "Phase P3 \u2014 Provider liveness with no fixed total deadline", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L427-463", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pins deadline_ms:null and the 15-minute busy-without-verifiable-progress stall, with PROCESS_STALLED plus explicit cancellation and preserved diagnostics; external worktree uncommitted status must remain a dependency caveat rather than a claimed release."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_phase_p4", "label": "Phase P4 \u2014 Phase design, task completion and evidence handoff", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L465-501", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each Phase must pre-declare design tasks, environment, test or not_applicable reason, final evidence and STOP, and the runtime must validate composite ACs, FR/AC coverage, RED/GREEN and task completion fields without adding a fifth authority."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_test_strategy", "label": "Test strategy \u2014 paired RED/GREEN commands and oracle identities (ORACLE-P1..P4)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L232-241", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each behaviour task shares one executable Vitest command and oracle identity; build-plan designs the commands but only build-code executes them, recording raw stdout, exit code and phase evidence."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_engineering_risk_handoff", "label": "Engineering risk handoff \u2014 PLAN-RISK-001..004", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L249-281", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Named risks: missing real interaction host, external broker hard deadline or internal retry, config route drift versus historical records, and phase evidence turning into a second authority; each carries affected IDs, trigger, STOP mitigation and verification."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_file_boundary", "label": "File boundary \u2014 NEW / MODIFY / DO NOT TOUCH lists", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L97-158", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "make-decision/steps.json is verified correct and must not be rewritten (test the order instead); canonical review result, task store and the host bridge stay untouched to avoid a second authority; external dirty hunks must be preserved without reset or checkout."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_direction_packet_contract", "label": "direction-review.v1 packet contract (public_request_count: 1)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L93", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The packet fixes visible fields per step and forbids handing the current selection to the reconstruct step; WorkflowHub validates schema, single call and order evidence, and records PROTOCOL_INCOMPATIBLE/unavailable rather than falling back to two requests when the broker cannot honour the flow."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_document", "target": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_decision_log_document", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_document", "target": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_spec_document", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_dec_003", "target": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_decision_log_d_010", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-execution-flow-repair-20260818/plan.md", "source_location": "L186", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_20260818_plan_dec_002", "target": "specs_archive_workflowhub_execution_flow_repair_2026